msgid ""
"The pan console allows you to move across the map at a fixed height. Click "
"and drag to move\n"
"continuously. The farther you drag from the center, the faster you will "
"move."
msgstr ""
"La consola panoràmica us permet moure't pel mapa a una alçada fixa. Feu "
"clic i arrossegueu per moure's contínuament. Com més arrossegueu del "
"centre, més ràpid us moureu."

msgid "Camera console"
msgstr "Consola de càmera"

msgid ""
"The camera console moves the camera's view only. Click and drag to change "
"the camera's view.\n"
"The farther you drag from the center, the faster you will change the view."
msgstr ""
"La consola de la càmera només mou la vista de la càmera. Feu clic i "
"arrossegueu per canviar la vista de la càmera.\n"
