msgid ""
"LAI (Leaf Area Index) is defined as half the total area of green elements "
"of the canopy per unit horizontal ground area. It is expressed in m²/m²."
msgstr ""
"El LAI (Índex d'àrea foliar) es defineix com la meitat de l'àrea total dels "
"elements verds del dosser per unitat d'àrea horitzontal de terreny. "
"S'expressa en m²/m²."

msgid ""
"Length of the semi-period before the dekadal date of the compositing window "
