msgid ""
"Dry Matter Productivity is defined as the overall growth rate, or dry "
"biomass increase, of the vegetation. It is expressed in kg of Dry Matter "
"per hectare and per day (kg DM/ha/day)."
msgstr ""
"La productivitat de matèria seca es defineix com la taxa de creixement "
"global, o l'increment de biomassa seca, de la vegetació. S'expressa en kg "
"de matèria seca per hectàrea i dia (kg DM/ha/dia)."

msgid ""
"GPP is defined as the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day."
msgstr ""
"La GPP es defineix com la quantitat total de compostos de carboni produïts "
"per la fotosíntesi de les plantes en un ecosistema durant un període de "
"temps determinat, expressada en gC/m²/dia."

msgid ""
"NPP is defined as the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced by plants "
"per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day."
msgstr ""
"L'NPP es defineix com la quantitat neta de biomassa, o de carboni, produïda "
"per les plantes per unitat d'àrea i de temps, expressada en gC/m²/dia."

msgid ""
"GDMP represents the total amount of dry matter produced by land plants per "
"unit time through photosynthesis. It is expressed in kg of Dry Matter per "
"hectare and per day (kg DM/ha/day)."
msgstr ""
"La GDMP representa la quantitat total de matèria seca produïda per les "
"plantes terrestres per unitat de temps mitjançant la fotosíntesi. "
"S'expressa en kg de matèria seca per hectàrea i dia (kg DM/ha/dia)."

